1
00:00:03,294 --> 00:00:05,214
- Who wants the last dumpling?
- Ooh, me.

2
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:07,300
(Sheldon:)Penny, a moment.

3
00:00:07,465 --> 00:00:09,555
(Sheldon:)We just had Thai food.

4
00:00:09,718 --> 00:00:13,508
In that cuIture, the last morsel
is called the krengjai piece.

5
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:19,600
(Sheldon:)And it is reserved for the most important
and valued member of the group.

6
00:00:24,274 --> 00:00:27,404
Thank you all for this high honor.

7
00:00:28,987 --> 00:00:32,367
(Sheldon:)I've seen pictures of your mother.
Keep eating.

8
