10
00:00:46,129 --> 00:00:48,969
...but when I say "honey,"
I mean my fiancée.

11
00:00:51,843 --> 00:00:53,803
(Howard:)Yeah, well, now it means her.

12
00:00:55,930 --> 00:00:57,720
(Bernadette:)It's okay if he wants to come.

13
